      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SOMETHING DARK (3) Gave a strong sight when 2nd last run at this venue in 18.32s over 320m. Has shown early pace in races to date. No surprise to see a forward showing and one of the main hopes in this race. MIDNIGHT SMOKE (2) Chimed in with a win last start around here and hard to fault at this distance. Has good early speed and will be nicely positioned. Performing honestly this campaign. Capable of forward showing and can be competitive. HEAR NO GRIEF (1) On a short back up. Narrowly beaten last time around here and will be aiming for a soft run from the draw. Should muster plenty of early toe. Expect to go close. MISS TESS (9) Looked good when 3rd last start at Goulburn. Must be considered.",
